WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.570
Choose who covers your approvals and tasks while you are on leave, from and until which day.

2
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:13.990
Going on leave? Hand over your approvals and tasks before you go.

3
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.860
Choose Away.

4
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:25.730
It is filled in for you. A manager can also set it for someone on the team.

5
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.080
Choose who covers for you.

6
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:33.840
Set the first and the last day you are away.

7
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:40.390
Add a note for your colleagues.

8
00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:49.230
Save. Dina is told, decides your approvals while you are away, and sees your tasks in her day.

9
00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:55.760
Away now and planned lists every cover. End one early when you are back.
